{"page":{"id":"968f1b09-1cd8-40b7-8439-bf24263c0b0f","theme":"world-of-warcraft","slug":"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king","title":"The Lich King","meta_title":"The Lich King (Warcraft) — person, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Lich King is the master of the Scourge, first Ner'zhul bound in ice, then Arthas Menethil enthroned at Icecrown. Related pages: Arthas Menethil,…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Dark lord of the <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king/scourge\" class=\"entity-link\">Scourge</a> on the Frozen Throne.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king/arthas-menethil\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Arthas Menethil</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king/scourge\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Scourge</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Icecrown</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king/frostmourne\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Frostmourne</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/warcraft-iii\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Warcraft III</strong></a> and <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Northrend</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How The Lich King connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcr