/a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/forsaken\" class=\"entity-link\">Forsaken</a> is connected to The Lich King through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">5</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king/arthas-menethil\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Arthas Menethil</strong>\n                    <span>Prince of Lordaeron who became the Lich King.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/northrend/icecrown/lich-king/frostmourne\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Frostmourne</strong>\n                    <span>Runeblade that claimed Arthas&#039;s soul.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/warcraft-iii\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Warcraft III</strong>\n                    <span>RTS that defined modern Warcraft lore.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <di